window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-07017c95818db8d0"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"validate-bulk-rna-seq-inputs\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"bulk-rna-seq\">验证 bulk RNA-seq 输入</h1> <p>在差异表达分析前验证 bulk RNA-seq 输入。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT 与 NGS Analysis 插件验证样本表、FASTQ 文件和参考序列，然后返回 MultiQC、Salmon 矩阵、来源记录，以及差异表达分析前的简短质控解读。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要在差异表达分析前验证 bulk RNA-seq 输入的生物信息学团队。</li> <li>希望在同一聊天中完成转录本和基因层面的定量与质控的研究人员。</li> <li>需要检查比对率、重复率、文库类型及资源就绪情况的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>NGS Analysis（已阻止不安全链接）</td> <td>验证测序输入、运行 bulk RNA-seq 计数与质控，并返回可审计的产物。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">起步提示词</h2> <p>运行 Bulk RNA-seq 计数与质控</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">使用 NGS Analysis 插件。\n\n对所提供的样本表、FASTQ 根目录、转录组 FASTA、基因组 FASTA 和 GTF 运行 bulk RNA-seq 的 FASTQ 到计数质控。\n\n返回：\n- run_manifest.json\n- MultiQC 报告及可在浏览器中安全打开的审阅链接\n- Salmon 转录本层面和基因层面的矩阵\n- 验证与资源就绪情况产物\n- 一段简短的质控解读，指出比对率、重复率、文库类型是否一致、离群样本，以及任何会阻碍后续差异表达分析的问题\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">申请 GPT-Rosalind 访问权限（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"leverage-skills\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">利用技能</h2> <p>NGS Analysis 插件包含：</p> <ul> <li><code>ngs-analysis-router</code></li> <li><code>ngs-bulk-rnaseq-counts-qc</code></li> <li><code>ngs-runtime-env</code></li> </ul> <p>使用该插件时，ChatGPT 可以调用这些打包好的技能。</p> <p><a id=\"step-by-step-guide\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">分步指南</h2> <ol> <li>将包含样本表、FASTQ、转录组 FASTA、基因组 FASTA 和 GTF 的目录提供给 ChatGPT，或给出这些文件的准确路径。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，让 ChatGPT 在执行前验证链特异性、参考文件一致性和工具就绪情况。</li> <li>在 ChatGPT 中打开生成的 MultiQC 报告和矩阵产物，检查比对率、重复率、文库类型一致性及资源就绪情况。</li> <li>在同一聊天中继续处理阻塞问题；更新元数据后重新运行，或将生成的基因层面矩阵交给后续差异表达分析。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"results\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">结果</h2> <p>本次运行返回的是经过质控审阅的计数结果包，而不只是未经整理的定量输出。先查看 MultiQC 报告，找出可能影响后续解读的警告。在此示例中，ChatGPT 会在运行摘要旁显示 FastQC 的序列组成警告，方便团队判断观察到的模式是否符合文库制备预期。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">在 bulk RNA-seq 运行摘要旁审阅 FastQC 序列组成警告。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-1.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>在 bulk RNA-seq 运行摘要旁审阅 FastQC 序列组成警告。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>接着，在同一份报告中查看 Salmon 统计数据。比对率、文库类型判定和重复率信号，可在差异表达分析开始前提供紧凑的就绪情况检查。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">检查生成的 MultiQC 报告中的 Salmon 比对统计和文库类型统计。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-2.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>检查生成的 MultiQC 报告中的 Salmon 比对统计和文库类型统计。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>最终的基因层面计数矩阵会保存为可复用的产物。在 ChatGPT 中打开它，确认预期的样本和特征均已包含，然后将它与本次运行的来源记录一并保存，以供后续分析使用。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">打开生成的基因层面计数矩阵，以便用于后续审阅。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-3.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>打开生成的基因层面计数矩阵，以便用于后续审阅。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure>","en":"<h1 id=\"validate-bulk-rna-seq-inputs\">Validate bulk RNA-seq inputs</h1> <p>Validate bulk RNA-seq inputs before differential expression.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with the NGS Analysis plugin to validate sample sheets, FASTQs, and references, then return MultiQC, Salmon matrices, provenance, and a short QC interpretation before differential expression.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Bioinformatics teams validating bulk RNA-seq inputs before differential expression.</li> <li>Researchers who want transcript and gene-level quantification plus QC in one chat.</li> <li>Teams that need mapping-rate, duplication, library-type, and resource-readiness review.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>NGS Analysis (blocked unsafe link)</td> <td>Validate sequencing inputs, run bulk RNA-seq counts and QC, and return auditable artifacts.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Run Bulk RNA-seq Counts and QC</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use the NGS Analysis plugin.\n\nRun bulk RNA-seq FASTQ-to-count QC on the provided sample sheet, FASTQ root, transcriptome FASTA, genome FASTA, and GTF.\n\nReturn:\n- run_manifest.json\n- MultiQC plus browser-safe review links\n- Salmon transcript- and gene-level matrices\n- validation and resource-readiness artifacts\n- a short QC interpretation that calls out mapping rate, duplication, library-type agreement, outlier samples, and anything that would block downstream differential expression\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Request access to GPT-Rosalind (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"leverage-skills\">Leverage skills</h2> <p>The NGS Analysis plugin includes:</p> <ul> <li><code>ngs-analysis-router</code></li> <li><code>ngs-bulk-rnaseq-counts-qc</code></li> <li><code>ngs-runtime-env</code></li> </ul> <p>When you use the plugin, ChatGPT can use all these packaged skills.</p> <h2 id=\"step-by-step-guide\">Step-by-step guide</h2> <ol> <li>Point ChatGPT to a directory with the sample sheet, FASTQs, transcriptome FASTA, genome FASTA, and GTF, or provide exact file references.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt so ChatGPT can validate strandedness, reference consistency, and tool readiness before execution.</li> <li>Open the generated MultiQC and matrix artifacts in ChatGPT to review mapping rate, duplication, library-type agreement, and resource readiness.</li> <li>Continue in the same chat to fix blockers, rerun with updated metadata, or hand the resulting gene-level matrices into downstream differential expression.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"results\">Results</h2> <p>The run returns a QC-reviewed counts bundle rather than a bare quantification output. Start with the MultiQC report to identify warnings that could affect downstream interpretation. In this example, ChatGPT surfaces FastQC sequence-content warnings alongside the run summary so the team can decide whether the observed pattern is expected for the library preparation.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Review FastQC sequence-content warnings alongside the bulk RNA-seq run summary. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-1.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Review FastQC sequence-content warnings alongside the bulk RNA-seq run summary. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>Next, review the Salmon statistics in the same report. Mapping rates, library-type assignments, and duplication signals provide a compact readiness check before differential expression.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Inspect Salmon alignment and library-type statistics from the generated MultiQC report. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-2.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Inspect Salmon alignment and library-type statistics from the generated MultiQC report. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>The resulting gene-level count matrix is saved as a reusable artifact. Open it in ChatGPT to confirm the expected samples and features are present, then keep it with the run provenance for downstream analysis.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Open the generated gene-level count matrix for downstream review. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-3.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Open the generated gene-level count matrix for downstream review. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/bulk-rna-seq-fastq-qc-screenshot-3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure>"};
